OL,3,AAnthropic shares fall a day after
OL,4,Ablockbuster opening
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthropic's share price has dropped to
OL,7,Fnear $88, back towards its initial
OL,8,Fpublic offering price of of $83, after
OL,9,Fa soaring market debut.
OL,11,FThe artificial intelligence (AI)
OL,12,Fcompany's debut on the Nasdaq stock
OL,13,Fexchange on Thursday was a crucial test
OL,14,Ffor the industry, and was largely seen
OL,15,Fas a success with trading beginning at
OL,16,F$111.50 and peaking at $115.
OL,18,FBut while Anthropic's shares flew past
OL,19,Fthe allocation price on Thursday, other
OL,20,Ftech stocks suffered.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
